    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">1:16</a> NOWNESS的接待服务和「钞能力」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="248">4:08</a> NOWNESS的选片、全球化的策展策略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">6:21</a> 对比西宁FIRST，独特的策展设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> 在上海，影展的选址很有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 电影节与城市风格的关联</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> NOWNESS的评审团设置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> NOWNESS 的小活动：时尚大片和晚宴</span></p><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 具体聊一下作品吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> &nbsp;张曜元《相谈》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 陈浤《下风处》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> &nbsp;李怡蓓《波动》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 关于电影中的香烟文化，很不好！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">41:09</a> 鲁一澄《那天，妈妈晚上没回家》</span></p>]]></description>
