  <item>
    <title>中国最牛的电影节，就这？｜草台班子的FIRST游记｜Vol.5</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f961dc6c7f817786f90d4b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f961dc6c7f817786f90d4b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Sep 2024 14:19:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">04:14</a> 电影节，大家不太想聊电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 即使在网络时代，影节上的片子也许再也不会见。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 网络让我们看到“彼可取而代之”的可能。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a> 西宁快乐瞬间：步行距离与城市结构。FIRST 的活动环节设计。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 疲惫：对于电影节酒会文化的疑问。作息失调。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1518">25:18</a> 酒会之外的交流：加微信像是集邮？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 一些人让中国电影不会玩完，一些人显然没什么思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> 在西安匪夷所思的“创作者对谈”：怎么变成了毕业答辩？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3387">56:27</a> 电影节的志愿者们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4018">1:06:58</a> 从节日回归日常。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4321">1:12:01</a> 《小说家》在西宁的遭遇：印象深刻的映后QA。&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
